				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T02:48:58" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>FIGHTERW
カレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
